  "notes": [
    "-ER verb with an o→ue stem change in the stressed syllables: presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), subjuntivo presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), and imperativo afirmativo tú/usted/ustedes forms. Nosotros/nosotras always reverts to the unstressed stem (envolvemos, envolvamos), as expected for -ER/-AR stem-changers.",
    "Irregular past participle: **envuelto** (not *envolvido*) — used throughout the compound tenses (Pretérito Perfecto, Pluscuamperfecto, Futuro Compuesto).",
    "*Voy a envolver el regalo antes de la fiesta.* (\"I'm going to wrap the gift before the party.\")",
    "*Ella envolvió al bebé en una manta.* (\"She wrapped the baby in a blanket.\")",
    "Related: *el envoltorio* (wrapper/wrapping), *desenvolver* (to unwrap — same stem-change and irregular participle: desenvuelto), *envolverse* (reflexive, \"to get wrapped up in / involved in\")."
  ],
